Closes #9999 

Here is a request parsing speed test:

``` php
public function actionTestRequestParsing($page, $perPage = 10)
    {
        $rules = Yii::$app->urlManager->rules;
        $ourRule = end($rules);
        /** @var $ourRule UrlRule */
        $start = microtime(true);
        for ($i = 0; $i < 100000; $i++) {
            $result = $ourRule->parseRequest(Yii::$app->urlManager, Yii::$app->request);
        }
        var_dump(microtime(true) - $start);
        Yii::$app->end();
    }
```

